{"product_id":"buture-vac01-cordless-stick-vacuum","title":"Buture VAC01 Aromatherapy Cordless Vacuum | 600W 50KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Buture VAC01 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner - Your ultimate cleaning companion. This advanced cordless vacuum features a robust 600W motor with 50kPa suction power, ensuring exceptional performance across all surfaces. With its self-standing design, smart touch screen, and versatile cleaning modes, the VAC01 offers a superior cleaning experience for every home. Enjoy convenience with the integrated wall mount and a comprehensive accessory kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Buture VAC01 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIncredible and Uninterrupted Cleaning\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"numPr\":{\"id\":\"0\",\"level\":0},\"rPr\":{\"bold\":false,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"宋体\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"hint\":\"default\"},\"sz\":10.5,\"szUnit\":\"pt\"},\"uuid\":\"m8r57jqvete1g6jzrpy\",\"jc\":\"justify\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":false,\"fonts\":{\"ascii\":\"Arial\",\"cs\":\"Arial\",\"eastAsia\":\"宋体\",\"hAnsi\":\"Arial\",\"hint\":\"default\"},\"sz\":10.5,\"szUnit\":\"pt\",\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Powered with high-performance 550W motor to provide accelerated 45kPA suction, the Buture VAC01 Vacuum Cleaner effortlessly lifts surface debris and embedded dirt, outperforming 95% of vacuums on the market, making it ideal for both carpets and hard floors. Enjoy an uninterrupted cleaning routine with its 8-cell lithium battery when ridding your home of various hair, dirt, and other messes.\"]]]]' data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4jKqmoRaA1eZlw19\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"text\"\u003ePowered with high-performance 600W motor to provide accelerated 50kPA suction, the Buture VAC01 Vacuum Cleaner effortlessly lifts surface debris and embedded dirt, outperforming 95% of vacuums on the market, making it ideal for both carpets and hard floors. Enjoy an uninterrupted cleaning routine with its 8-cell lithium battery when ridding your home of various hair, dirt, and other messes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExceptional Suction Power:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tackles stubborn dirt and pet hair with ease, ensuring a thorough clean.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for all types of surfaces, from carpets to hardwood floors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEfficient Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Provides superior cleaning results, saving time and effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSelf-Standing Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VAC01 features a self-standing design, allowing you to pause and resume cleaning without needing to lean the vacuum against a wall. This design ensures easy storage and access, making it perfect for quick clean-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHands-Free Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Conveniently pauses and resumes cleaning without hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpace-Saving Storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stand it upright anywhere in your home for easy access and storage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Stability:\u003c\/strong\u003e Reduces the risk of tipping over, ensuring safety and longevity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIntegrated Wall Charging Mount\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VAC01 comes with an integrated wall mount that functions as both a charging station and storage solution. Charge your vacuum quickly and keep accessories organized, or remove the battery for separate charging if preferred.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConvenient Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wall mount charges the vacuum and stores accessories, ready for the next use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlexible Charging Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Remove the battery for separate charging if needed.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOrganized Storage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep your cleaning tools neatly arranged and accessible.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSmart Touch Screen with 4 Cleaning Modes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe intuitive smart touch screen allows easy mode selection with a simple touch. Choose from ECO, STANDARD, BOOST, or AUTO modes to suit different cleaning tasks and floor types. AUTO mode adjusts suction power automatically for optimal performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eModes:\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003col class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBOOST Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50kPa for deep cleaning carpets and removing pet hair.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSTANDARD Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30kPa for routine cleaning tasks on various surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eECO Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e 18kPa for light cleaning and energy conservation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eAdvanced Multi-Layer Filtration System\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VAC01 features a sophisticated multi-layer filtration system to ensure a clean and allergen-free environment. The system includes a stainless steel filter, HEPA filter, sponge filter, and more to capture particles of all sizes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStainless Steel Filter: Captures large debris and hair.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEPA Filter: Traps fine dust and allergens for cleaner air.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSponge Filter: Adds an extra layer of dust capture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMotor Air Cooling Filter: Protects the motor for consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDust Cup: Holds and collects dust and debris efficiently.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VAC01 Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vac01-table\" style=\"width: 101.25%; height: 553px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e600W\/50kPa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eUp to 60 minutes (Boost mode: 30 mins)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eSelf-Standing\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eItem Weight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e6 Pounds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003eDust Cup Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50.0894%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"\u003e1.5 Liters\u003c\/sp